├── src/main/java/com/yourcompany/kubernetes/logs/
│   ├── KubernetesClient.java        // Main client interface
│   ├── KubernetesClientImpl.java    // Implementation
│   ├── KubernetesConfig.java        // Configuration
│   ├── LogStream.java              // Streaming logs interface
│   └── exceptions/                 // Custom exceptions
├── build.gradle                    // Or pom.xml
```

## 2. Core Implementation

### KubernetesConfig.java
