Here's an ACL configuration for Tailscale that implements your requirements with the three groups (`nill`, `family`, and `servers`) and their respective access rules:

```json
{
  "groups": {
    "group:nill":    ["user1@example.com", "user2@example.com"],
    "group:family":  ["user3@example.com", "user4@example.com"],
